      "statement": "The LangGraph monorepo contains eight interdependent libraries: checkpoint (base interfaces for persistence), checkpoint-postgres, checkpoint-sqlite (Postgres and SQLite checkpoint implementations), langgraph (core orchestration framework), prebuilt (high-level agent APIs), cli (command-line tooling), sdk-py (Python API client), and sdk-js (JavaScript/TypeScript API client).",
