      "id": "claim_e71d1a2923e74efd99d91f1c94fce8d6",
      "statement": "The checkpoint library has no upstream dependencies and serves as the base interface. langgraph depends on checkpoint; prebuilt depends on langgraph; cli and sdk-py depend on langgraph; sdk-js is standalone. This forms a dependency tree where changes to checkpoint affect all dependent libraries.",
