      "statement": "StateGraph is the primary builder API for LangGraph applications. It accepts a typed state schema (TypedDict, dataclass, or Pydantic model) and provides methods to register nodes, edges, policies, and conditional routing before compilation into an executable CompiledStateGraph.",
